=== a Vim command Jasper lacks
divergent: Jasper has no abbreviations; a command it lacks fails with E319 (docs/vim-divergences.md)
text:
  one
  two
  three
  four
  five
  six
  seven
  eight
  nine
  ten
cursor: 1,1
keys: :ab x y<CR>
output: yes
--- expected
expect-text:
  one
  two
  three
  four
  five
  six
  seven
  eight
  nine
  ten
expect-cursor: 1,1
expect-mode: normal
expect-output:
  E319: Sorry, the command is not available in this version

